I was thinking about how unfair the clan system was this time. If you
averaged the scores, then single players will benefit, but as it is
right now than the more players is an advantage. I was thinking that
a clan should be allowed as many players as they want, but only the
top eight scores should be allowed. The advantage of more players are
then minimized. You can also average the score of players but that
the lowest number you can have is 8. So a clan of one will still have
their score divided by 8 (or 6 or 4) but a clan of 16 will have their
score divided by 16. 

